{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_ncdeer_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_ncdeer_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "大慈惻隱",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ncdeer_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e7d7f20ae5f386734000de9196121dad38abb338b7cc859d0de6562a05f4455f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求求您，求求您！行行好，您就答應我吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要能治好那富商的孩子，就能拿到一大筆賞金，求您了醫生，我、我給您幹活，您要我幹什麼，絕無二話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的妻子給我寫了信，她和孩子待的城鎮要來天災，他們錯過了時間，沒辦法出來了。但要是在那裡待著，我實在不放心......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道是我貪心了，您救過我，我原不該再求您什麼，您不樂意下山，我都知道，但我實在是沒有辦法了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一拿到這筆錢，就去找人帶我妻兒出來，絕不做他用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您就幫我這一回，您就是救了我的命了！我對天起誓！如果說出去，我滿身生癩，不得好死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的藥有用，她的藥有用！謝謝恩人，謝謝恩人啊！我對天起誓！您的恩情，我來日必報，若違誓言，我滿身生癩，不得好死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚嗚娘......您吃這個，您有救了，嗚嗚嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "藥不夠了？沒事，九色鹿醫生在的，沒事的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通訊斷了好幾天了，還有什麼方法能聯絡到外面嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼越來越多的人死了，怎麼回事？不是說九色鹿都能救的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那個女人不太對勁啊，她從哪裡來的，她救我們......怎麼不收錢？她是不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個女人就是為了宣傳自己的藥，博取大家的信任才留在這的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看她的源石技藝，是她帶來的天災！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶來災禍的埃拉菲亞，滾出去！滾出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為我救他們，他們就會信任我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我治療他們，愛著他們，我們就能和平相處......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是這樣的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不願與山下人再有糾葛，你不該來找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去吧。別再來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了，是、是我癡心妄想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打擾了，我自己去想辦法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼晚了，您還是來啦。我就猜到您會來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個富商的孩子，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那孩子現在就在診所，病得奇怪，一日一日衰弱下去。飯倒還能吃一些，只是嗜睡得厲害，天天喊著脖子痛，連燒了好幾天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她父親急得不得了，四處打聽到我們這裡有位能妙手回春的醫生，告示貼得人盡皆知，我想著您肯定要下來問問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人罹病，我怎麼會見死不救呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，今早有個人找來我住的地方了，這幾日我會換個地方住著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是您救過的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總是有這樣的人......您都說了不要來找，為什麼就是不聽呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無事，我以後會多加注意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，您還在這裡我就很高興啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，子書。帶我去看看那孩子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......痛......痛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這孩子的病......不尋常啊。這回不是我拿點草藥來你們就能治好的情況了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子書，這回我會在山下住兩日，除了患者，誰都不見，就拜託你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道啦，有我盯著，不會讓人隨意進來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，還有件事要托你明日和那富商說一說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這回人們會怎麼想我？冷酷無情的......埃拉菲亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩錢、半錢、三錢，這些草藥，製成藥丸......連服八天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好苦，好苦......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，別擔心，你喜歡什麼味的？花花，還是茶葉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喜歡花花......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，你看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在聞聞看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......甜甜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吃吧，吃吧，吃了藥，香香甜甜的，就不痛啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，這個......為什麼是甜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為有你這樣的小哭包呀，小哭包為了不吃藥哭，甜甜的你是不是就願意吃了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等吃完了，姐姐給你做蜜糖吃好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九色鹿醫生，這麼晚了，您該休息了！三天沒闔眼了，熬壞了自己的身子，對誰都沒好處啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，我要把這本看完，這本很重要，看完就吃飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您的飯剛才我已經讓您吃過了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，啊......那就看完就睡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在就去睡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_landscape"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二日"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "王二！還在外面晃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事少來煩我，忙著呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了，錢還不夠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒手藝的就是難啊，我那日聽富商手下說自家小姐被一個厲害的醫生救了，富商家的小姐啊！那醫生應該是能拿不少錢啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......被厲害的醫生救了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也抓緊點，都過去幾天了，要想安全，還是得儘早把你家人都接回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能，她不是說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生不是這樣的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我今晚一定要去看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這味藥......不行，這個也不行，都是不能同服，之前的筆記上記了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小瓷身體也虛，之前餵的藥還是猛了些，劑量還需要再斟酌一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這味藥副作用太大，小瓷受不住，下次不可再加......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這味藥小瓷有些過敏，也不能用，還需要再換......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還不夠，我的知識還是不夠，還要看更多的書才行，還要再嘗試才行。小瓷的身體撐不了太久，沒有時間了，我要抓緊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和他們採藥回來了，這些都是您早上說要的......您頭髮怎麼亂成這樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......這裡，你看這裡，這個藥方它——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您說，我給您梳理一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩個藥性相衝不好放在一起，但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......啊，我知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我上山一趟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你頭髮就亂著吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大晚上的......您真的要現在就去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_coldforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走快些，天亮之前應該能回去，這一劑方成了，小瓷的病就能好得快些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，這個毒草，長得好像野菜，要記下來存著，別被這裡的人採去誤食了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前給沒長成的藥草都分別做了記號，看來還是不行，以後再遇到沒長成的，還是移到院子裡去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望沒有被蟲食掉......不亂想了，先上山吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天亮起來了，這回怎麼找了這麼久都沒看到？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......在這裡有嗎？之前留的記號，幾日沒來加固，好像分辨不清了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶！這毒草，沒有注意就......回去再處理吧。只是這裡再往上的話，就不是藥草的生長環境了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“其色若雪，味清苦，多見於岩縫中，或生於懸崖之上。”懸崖之上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，好累，現在攀崖的話......不行，小瓷等不及了，必須儘快拿回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "書上說繩結應該這樣打，沒想到在這裡也用上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望不會出事吧，嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......醫生，在替那孩子治病？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是說不願下山？不是......不是拒絕了嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......為什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "燒已經退了，晨起也吃了藥粥，沒有吐，晚飯時候看脖子腫塊消下去了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九色鹿姐姐，你頭髮的顏色為什麼和我們不一樣呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......你看看這裡，這個花紋呢，漂亮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！爹爹說過，姐姐是大好人，所以姐姐頭髮才會這麼漂亮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐，我爹爹也是好人，為什麼你不相信他呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不相信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子書姐姐不讓爹爹說是姐姐救了我，也不讓我以後說是姐姐救了我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小瓷，我救你們，也救大家，這樣就很好了，不用再多說什麼，也不用再多做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這幾日，爹爹都去哪了?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐有件事拜託你爹爹，過幾日他就能回來了，到時候小瓷要健健康康地見爹爹，好嗎?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，今天說了太多的話了，不早了，先躺下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那今天給你講的故事，是很久很久以前，在山林裡，有一個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_landscape"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩日後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊——多久都沒出來伸懶腰了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您最近翻的醫書快把外屋堆滿了，好好歇歇眼睛吧。今天陽光不錯，也暖和，我待會兒把小瓷的被褥也拿出來曬曬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小瓷病漸漸好起來了，您心裡也是開心的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，過會兒我也要再看看需不需要換幾味藥。拿把躺椅，叫小瓷也出來透透氣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去烹點茶，您要喝什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都可，你烹的都很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一杯加點糖！小瓷還是愛喝甜的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加了糖的茶不是茶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子書姐姐，我想喝甜的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧好吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......萬里無雲，好天氣呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小瓷，你最近說喜歡的那個句子，是什麼來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“小晴日，和絮飛飛，點點瓷輕繪。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "裡面有我的名字！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，把被角掖好，別讓風吹到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開門，開門！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰在敲門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人嗎！有人嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，你在吧！我知道你在這，我親眼看見你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的、真的在給富商的女兒治病，是不是？！我以為你不要錢財，以為你清清白白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我信了你，結果呢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，哪個醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎哎，發生什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他這說的什麼鬼話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生了什麼事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，你在裡頭，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城鎮那邊說人都疏散完了，但是我妻兒現在和我斷了聯絡不知道多少天了，他們現在都不知道在哪！天災......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我籌不到錢，救不了妻兒，是我自己沒用，我不怨別人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我想問你，我們這群人在你眼裡，是不是就是傻子？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你騙我，就是想要那些錢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我想要錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有這種事？也太過分了，不幫就算了，怎麼還騙人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哪位醫生啊，這麼壞，我以後都不敢來看病了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給個說法！給個說法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就知道會這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我以為我救他們，他們就會信任我。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我治療他們，愛著他們，我們就能和平相處。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（是這樣的嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你胡說！姐姐沒有收我們的錢！咳咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你別跑，別跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事......我不能讓人欺負姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這些壞人！你們怎麼能這樣想......姐姐她，她，不是那樣的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......小瓷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，小瓷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去與他說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你終於出來了，醫生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路過的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "門開了門開了......是哪個醫生啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到醫生了——啊，怎麼是九色鹿醫生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？說的是那個九色鹿醫生？這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是個混帳，你們也是群混帳，這是九色鹿醫生啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我被石頭砸了都以為完了，家裡後事都準備上了，九色鹿醫生救了我，我才撿了條命回來啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦——就是這個醫生啊！我，那現在這是，該信誰啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼講出來了！我、我、九色鹿醫生不叫我說來著，但我不是偷偷和你們說過嗎！醫生沒收我錢，一分都沒收，還送了我一堆草藥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，是我！您還記得我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都聽到沒？我說的可全都是真的，九色鹿醫生肯定不是那樣的人！什麼貪財，這不可能！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "熱心的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九色鹿醫生，不管別人說什麼，您救過我，我信您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小瓷，爹爹回來了！你怎麼在這站著，這裡怎麼這麼多人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爹爹，你回來了！有壞人要欺負醫生姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他說姐姐騙了他，還不幫忙救他的妻兒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妻兒？是城鎮裡那兩個人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九色鹿醫生不收我的錢，只叫我幫忙，走我行商的路接了兩個人回來。現在人就安排在客棧裡，這是怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走行商的路從城鎮裡接人......難道說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我本不想讓你知道是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不願再與人有過多糾葛，這不是騙你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真的？我的家人，沒事......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若說的是我接回的婦人與孩子，我可以擔保，他們安然無恙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是醫生，是醫生幫了我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並非幫你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是......只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就是醫生幫了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我卻懷疑醫生，我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我都做了什麼啊......我實在是太混帳了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您這樣幫我，我、我沒臉見您了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無妨，也是我，沒有說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九色鹿醫生，小女的病真的勞您費心了，今天還遇到了這種事，也都怪我救女心切給您鬧了這麼多麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在外面也認識不少人的，這回我算是欠您一個大人情了，如今這樣，不如我薦您去外面的大醫館就職如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_140",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生，別走啊，我、我要給您賠罪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡就挺好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_town"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "多日後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九色鹿醫生，小女的病如今已大好了，這是在下托人搜集來的各類醫術典籍，小小謝意，請您笑納！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生病小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_142",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "九色鹿姐姐，子書姐姐，我來啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "富商",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小瓷，規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的，病了這麼久，看著她活潑點也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我以為我救他們，他們就會信任我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太感謝您了......唉，上山一不留神，就被那毒草給刺了，本來以為洗洗就好了，哪想到腫成這樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "診所醫生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_141",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還說呢，再晚點你這就走不了路了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受傷的村民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝九色鹿醫生啊......我們村子裡有您，真的實在是，太好了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必言謝，以後自己小心點就是。這些草藥丸你拿些，再被尋常毒草劃了，可以吃些解毒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我治療他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......前幾日山崖上看到的藥草，我的記號是在這裡吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，不錯，沒有被蟲食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "秋日快到了，這些藥草都存些種子，以後自己種來試試看，應該會方便許多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "愛著他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_landscape"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玩鬧的小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，九色鹿姐姐被我抓住啦，我贏啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玩鬧的小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也要，我也要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玩鬧的小孩",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，這個香丸是我的，我贏了才有的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要吵，每個人最後都會有的，明天我們繼續玩，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我們就能和平相處，是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多年未見，這一畫，可解你心結？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凡有所見，皆是虛妄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，現在如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾年不見，我也該回去瞧瞧子書了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九色鹿",
      "speakerId": "avg_4019_ncdeer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過這幾味草藥，我還要給一個地方送去，算算日子......他們應該在這附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還給自己找了個事做？有趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可是興致盡了，哪也不願去......等這山開滿了花，我再來找你，同飲一杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_2015_dusk",
      "aliases": [
        "夕"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
